# Internal development governance. Keep evaluator-facing implementation,
# architecture, verification reports, tests, and evidence public; keep local
# planning and process-control documents private.
/starter_kit/docs/README.md
/starter_kit/docs/acceptance-matrix.md
/starter_kit/docs/design-decisions.md
/starter_kit/docs/requirements.md
/starter_kit/tests/README.md

# Hardware screenshots are optional and expose platform account identifiers.
# Raw platform results, normalized results, executed circuits, and job IDs are
# the authoritative public evidence.
/starter_kit/evidence/files/spinq-bell-result.png
/starter_kit/evidence/files/originq-bell-result.png

# Obsolete duplicate of the official underscore-named submission directory
/starter-kit/

# Local L1 hidden-set surrogate corpus and stress harness. These improve our
